## Summary

Add a pure, fail-closed steward_gate(head_sha, required_class) guard library to dopemux_pr_merge_specialist that loads MERGE_READINESS.json and the independent embedded_audit proof, enforces a triple-SHA freshness match plus TTL, and returns allow/deny. Not yet wired into any mutation seam.

## Scope

Allowlist-bound; see commit.allowlist. Out of scope: Do not wire the gate into any mutation seam (that is TP-202/203). Do not perform any gh mutation. Do not change schemas/proof/embedded_audit.schema.json enum values. The gate must be pure (no GitHub calls) and must deny on any missing, stale, or SHA-mismatched input.

## Validation

See commit.verify; embedded audit + proof bundle required.

